{"id": "12th_tamil_u4_q692", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "pathukaapaai_oru_payanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "stop_sign_shape", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உத்தரவுக் குறியீடுகளில் வழக்கத்திற்கு மாறாக 'நில்' (STOP) என்னும் குறியீடு எந்த தனித்துவ வடிவத்தில் அமைக்கப்பட்டிருக்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முக்கோணம்", "B": "வட்டம்", "C": "செவ்வகம்", "D": "எண்கோண வடிவம் (Octagonal)"}, "explanation": "உத்தரவுக் குறியீடுகளில் 'நில்' (STOP) சைகைக் குறியீடு எட்டுப் பக்கங்களைக் கொண்ட எண்கோண (Octagonal) வடிவில் அமைந்திருக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Distinct from typical circular mandatory signs, what geometric silhouette does the international 'STOP' sign uniquely feature?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Equilateral triangle", "B": "Circle", "C": "Rectangle", "D": "Octagonal (Eight-sided) shape"}, "explanation": "The STOP sign is uniquely octagonal across international traffic engineering standards."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 85, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":