{"id": "12th_tamil_u4_q760", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "u4_pyq_integration", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "venpaa_four_syllables_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வெண்பாவின் ஈற்றுச் சீர் வாய்ப்பாடுகளையும் அவற்றின் அசைகளையும் சரியாகப் பொருத்துக:\n1. நாள் - i. நிரைபு\n2. மலர் - ii. நேர்பு\n3. காசு - iii. நிரை\n4. பிறப்பு - iv. நேர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-i, 2-ii, 3-iii, 4-iv", "B": "1-iii, 2-iv, 3-i, 4-ii", "C": "1-ii, 2-i, 3-iv, 4-iii", "D": "1-iv, 2-iii, 3-ii, 4-i"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: நாள் - நேர்; மலர் - நிரை; காசு - நேர்பு; பிறப்பு - நிரைபு. எனவே (1-iv, 2-iii, 3-ii, 4-i) சரியானதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Correctly pair the terminal Venpa mnemonic formulas with their corresponding prosodic syllable patterns:\n1. Naal - i. Niraipu\n2. Malar - ii. Nerpu\n3. Kaasu - iii. Nirai\n4. Pirappu - iv. Ner", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-i, 2-ii, 3-iii, 4-iv", "B": "1-iii, 2-iv, 3-i, 4-ii", "C": "1-ii, 2-i, 3-iv, 4-iii", "D": "1-iv, 2-iii, 3-ii, 4-i"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Naal = Ner (iv), Malar = Nirai (iii), Kaasu = Nerpu (ii), Pirappu = Niraipu (i)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "pub